    {"text": "A fluttering thrill of anticipation raced through her veins.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "A sweet wave of relief washed over him.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Her heart leapt in her chest at the sound of the key in the door.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "All morning he fizzed like a shaken bottle.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Her spirits soared as high as the gulls.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "With a light, carefree heart, he sang all the way home.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "An uncontrollable fit of giggles burst out of them.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "A gentle, thankful warmth filled the room.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "She tingled from head to toe.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "He brimmed with glee, the mischievous, bright-eyed glee of a boy with a secret.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "A cold, gloating triumph crept into his voice.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "He gloated over every coin.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Euphoria took hold of the crowd, and strangers embraced like brothers.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Her joy was too large for the room; she had to run outside and shout.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Her happiness was edged with sadness, for there was no one to tell.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The delight faded as quickly as it had come.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "He looked at the sleeping child with a wonder that was close to bliss.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Her worries melted, and she glowed with quiet pleasure.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "His heart pounded with excitement, and his chest swelled.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "It was the exhilaration of the first day of the holidays.", "vibe": "General"},
